{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/15565-packet-theta","id":15565,"title":"Packet Theta","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2013-11-21T13:14:53-08:00","id":15565,"title":"Packet Theta","content":"So Packet Theta was found on the moon and is apparently the Bones/remains of an Angel. Did the US Government steal secrets from this, and is this one of the explanations for things such as Task Force VALKYRIE's technology? How would the Deva Corporation ever get their hands on something this high up in multiple conspiracies? And what type of benefits are derived from it? I guess some sort of secret knowledge or even power can be derived from it.<br /> <br /> Do you Believe that a similar discovery would be found under Ularu since that is the supposed site of another Angel?<br /> <br /> Is it so potent because it is of the highest Rank of the God Machines Angels? So would that make it Rank 7, or even 8 Angels?<br /> <br /> And last does anyone else feel that the Catalyst that the Shan'iatu found in the desert is a similar discovery?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-21T14:04:43-08:00","id":15615,"title":"","content":"I think it would be interesting to play around with the properties of angel remains. Angels don't die often, and the Machine probably retrieves them when it can. Demons normally leave behind whatever they were at the time -- human remains with maybe a quirk or two normally, and really strange bodies in their demonic forms. Angels, though, might leave bodies with occult potential even when appearing human. Their skeletons might be engraved with marks in a secret lettering, or the bones themselves might be made of some unknown, even radioactive, metal.<br /> <br /> <i>Hunter: Mortal Remains</i> has a chapter on demons. It's a <i>Vigil</i> supplement, so the Unchained-equivalents work on a simplified system and there are other demons included that appear to be related to the God-Machine but are clearly not Unchained. Which is just a list of caveats before I say that there's an artifact in the book that was once the heart of a demon, retrieved by her stigmatic lover.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-21T14:10:13-08:00","id":15622,"title":"","content":"Awesome!<br /> <br /> I reckon I'm gonna have to get Mortal Remains, now the name seems more and more fitting.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-21T22:42:25-08:00","id":15901,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/15565-packet-theta?p=15615#post15615\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><i>Hunter: Mortal Remains</i> has a chapter on demons. It's a <i>Vigil</i> supplement, so the Unchained-equivalents work on a simplified system and there are other demons included that appear to be related to the God-Machine but are clearly not Unchained. Which is just a list of caveats before I say that there's an artifact in the book that was once the heart of a demon, retrieved by her stigmatic lover.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hmm\u2026 perhaps some of these \u201cother demons\u201d might bear more of a resemblance to the \u201cSecond Race\u201d demons that the Pain Prophet describes? <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Continuum</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwscion\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#008000\">Scion</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwExalt\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#DAA520\">Exalted</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwcwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#800000\">World of Darkness</span></a>, <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwnwod\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">Chronicles of Darkness</span></a></div> </div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/421-dataweaver","name":"Dataweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar421_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8420"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-23T20:58:38-08:00","id":16919,"title":"","content":"I hope the other demons are usable outside of hunter <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-24T00:47:06-08:00","id":16997,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eldagusto</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/15565-packet-theta?p=16919#post16919\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I hope the other demons are usable outside of hunter <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>maybe Inferno?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/604-shock","name":"Shock","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar604_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1071"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-12T06:39:15-08:00","id":70540,"title":"","content":"Just reread the Pain Prophet story, so I'm wondering about the secret Conspiracy that led to the Spanish American War, Nuclear Weapons and Apollo Mission. And the Packet Theta surely must be of the highest rank of Angel, the 8 Angels that survived the fall of the first city sound like Rank 7 or so Angels.<br /> <br /> It makes me also think maybe the Gullet of Sekhem that the Shan'iatu found might be what is under the Sphinx?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-16T20:39:52-08:00","id":73526,"title":"","content":"Who says it's the bones?<br /> <br /> I seem to recall somewhere there being a story about an angel whose mission was to divert an asteroid.<br /> <br /> I also seem to recall that the God-Machine stores particularly unique or powerful angels between missions instead of recycling them.<br /> <br /> So perhaps what they've done is taken the space-bound Angel out of its storage space.<br /> <br /> So now a Trumpeter Angel is sent to tell the players they need to break out Packet Theta, get it powered back up, and get it into space again, or another asteroid is going to destroy the world.<br /> <br /> Boom, Tier 3/4 game right there.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-17T04:45:37-08:00","id":73656,"title":"","content":"I would have loved Inferno if it didn't use Power/Finesse/Resistance/Numina system. God I can't stand PFR...<br /> <br /> The angels using PFR is one of the major problems I have about DtD. Hell it was my big problem about WtF, and Strix Chronicle as well.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1229-torete","name":"torete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1229_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"125"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-17T08:56:45-08:00","id":73741,"title":"","content":"Well, if you don't want it to work that way then don't make it, for your game it can be different <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> And who knows, maybe they will change it in the future, though personally I don't mind it as it is.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1734-asaram","name":"Asaram","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1734_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"331"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-17T19:37:13-08:00","id":74043,"title":"","content":"Actually I am doing just that, building them out of PFR, at least for the NPCs I deem important. But yeah it's a lot of work <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> And I doubt that it will change, as I think they have passed the point of that change. Also, DtD and Blood and Smoke are both recent arrivals, and they us even more PFR antagonists than the games before.... The direction I don't love... but yeah....","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1229-torete","name":"torete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1229_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"125"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-17T19:40:09-08:00","id":74045,"title":"","content":"What is so horrible about Power/Finesse/Resistance? It's a great way to simplify opponents down to a manageable level for the ST. I hate having to come up with a full milieu of stats for everyone, but for spirits, ghosts and demons; I can make a whole new antagonist without a lot of time involved.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><u><b>My Homebrew</b></u><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1PLu_eTg03h4ogiTSGSkzEB7T_1YpB9_VkhHmgZN41-I/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Star Wars d10</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rIXZorT7CR5SREkdT3m0zbB3_gwf1484-gUVlG1JnhQ/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">T</a><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1rIXZorT7CR5SREkdT3m0zbB3_gwf1484-gUVlG1JnhQ/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">he Fallen for Demon: the Descent</a><br /> <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1-TDr4NF_5cUn-In2vjI9P5LTKqsu9B4-OMxbnbaTgT8/edit#\" target=\"_blank\">Requiem for a Masquerade: VtR 2e Cainite Conversion</a> (<a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1HpKi5giBNsQrZRLIRRjaCe7sHVm1Q13ravVYlE45Dbw/edit\" target=\"_blank\">Vampira Roma</a>)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1601-dreaminggod","name":"Dreaminggod","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1601_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"745"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-17T19:43:22-08:00","id":74051,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dreaminggod</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/15565-packet-theta?p=74045#post74045\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is so horrible about Power/Finesse/Resistance? It's a great way to simplify opponents down to a manageable level for the ST. I hate having to come up with a full milieu of stats for everyone, but for spirits, ghosts and demons; I can make a whole new antagonist without a lot of time involved.</div> </div> </div> </div>Well that's the 'pro' for PFR I guess <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> But I think it's matter of preferences, as I do love more in-depth antagonists, especially more 'unique' ones... PFR is very convenient and efficient system, but it IS kind of watered-down version of the stats. Not to mention harder to balance.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1229-torete","name":"torete","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1229_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"125"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-25T12:46:50-08:00","id":79519,"title":"","content":"THREAD NECROMANCY!<br /> <br /> Appropriate in a thread about the Angel of Death.<br /> <br /> No, but seriously - the idea of Packet Theta has been popping up in my games a bit lately. I'm immensely curious as to what anybody else has done with it! I'm speculating that some sort of moon base exists, built by defunct 'black project' Deva Aerospace, which was constructed with the help of NASA and the Apollo missions.<br /> <br /> Of course, because I -love- WoD weirdness, I'm also suggesting that they were possibly repurposing something even OLDER... the Reich's decaying moon base, established by the luftwaffe.<br /> <br /> So I'm trying to think of fun things to do with this structure. I'm thinking of it as sort of a strange 'Johnson Era' Aperture Science type feel, with the 1960's space tech from Nasa and Deva being moved into the old Nazi instillation.<br /> <br /> ... and then of course, what to do with the complex that's around the Angel itself! It's 'tomb'! It's it just like, a crater? I'm leaning, at this point, to creating some sort of Atlantian ruin...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/762-missmaddy","name":"MissMaddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar762_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-25T16:35:38-08:00","id":79743,"title":"","content":"@MissMaddy: I call for an Actual Play of this. Record the session, hire a transcriber for $5 on TaskRabbit, and polish it up between you and the players, and it'd be gold.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Once is happenstance. Twice is coincidence. Three times is enemy action. Four times is Infrastructure.<br /> <img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><br /> Rule #2: Never let the game-mechanics get in the way of a good story.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1642-paddon","name":"Paddon","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1642_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"326"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-26T20:14:43-08:00","id":80742,"title":"","content":"Packet Theta are not merely the remains of an Angel, but the remains of one of the first batch of Angels to exist. Its only known sibling is what we call the God-Machine in modern times.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/746-kunoichi","name":"Kunoichi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar746_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"348"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-01T11:37:04-08:00","id":82182,"title":"","content":"I think there's probably also mileage to be had with Packet Theta out of the fact we're talking about something found on the moon, a central symbolic icon for the Werewolf line.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>- Chris Allen, Aberrant Line Developer, Freelance Writer<br /> <br /> \u200bLike my work? Feel like helping me stay supplied with tea? Check out my <b><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/acrozatarim\" target=\"_blank\">Patreon</a></b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1757-acrozatarim","name":"Acrozatarim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1757_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1892"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-01T13:42:21-08:00","id":82282,"title":"","content":"Could somebody explain, in easy to understand terms, what kinda significance it has/might have? Assuming I have about as much knowledge about Werewolf as would be contained in, say, a wikipedia article.<br /> <br /> Hypothetically.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/762-missmaddy","name":"MissMaddy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar762_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"380"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-01T14:15:51-08:00","id":82301,"title":"","content":"When it comes to the Moon, getting there and doing stuff, I can't help but to imagine a character saying this: &quot;We can't stop here; this is Idigam country!&quot;<br /> <br /> About Werewolves and the Moon:<br /> <br /> In Forsaken, Luna is the spiritual mother of all werewolves, bride of Father Wolf and the one who bestowed Lunacy to the Uratha. She's probably the strongest ally the Forsaken have among the spirits. She's also quite insane, even for a Spirit.<br /> <br /> Her material reflection is where the Idigam were banished eons ago, which in turn would make any travel to the lunar surface a hazardous affair, to say the least.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 03-01-2014, 05:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-03-03T06:10:08-08:00","id":83130,"title":"","content":"\u2026which opens up the possibility that Package Theta doesen\u2019t have anything to do with the God-Machine after all, and is in fact the remains of an Idigam.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div style=\"margin-left:40px\"> <div align=\"center\">My hacks: <a href=\"http://tinyurl.com/dwtrin\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color:#0000FF\">Trinity Co